.git/**
.gitignore
.vscodeignore
scripts/**
test/**
docs/**
*.vsix
node_modules/**
# The language-service plugin, staged here by scripts/bundle-plugin.mjs so VS
# Code can resolve it by package name.
!node_modules/tw-sugarcube-ts-plugin/**
# ...and the analysis core it requires. Both of these are load-bearing: the
# plugin's `require("tw-sugarcube-analyzer/analyzer.js")` throws inside tsserver
# if the package isn't in the .vsix, and a throw there takes down the whole
# language service rather than degrading. Verify with `npx vsce ls` after
# changing anything here.
!node_modules/tw-sugarcube-analyzer/**
.claude
